<td id="S5.T1.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.25pt 5.0pt;">0.82</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
