<a href="#S7.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" title="Control-theoretic foundations. ‣ 7 Related Work ‣ Adversarial Intent is a Latent Variable:Stateful Trust Inference for Securing Multimodal Agentic RAG" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§7</span></a>.
